      "estimand": "Average causal effect of substituting one offensive player for another on the shot-type distribution of the immediate subsequent stint, conditioning on defensive lineup and game state.",
      "unit": "Stint: a continuous segment of play with the same offensive five on the floor, starting at the substitution that changes the five and ending when another offensive substitution occurs or a period ends. Minimum 3 possessions; stints overlapping end-of-period or garbage time excluded.",
