      "multiplicity": "Pre-register primary shot-type categories: rim, midrange (short mid and long mid), three-point, and derived play types PULL_UP, CATCH_SHOOT, POST_UP, DRIVE. Use Benjamini-Hochberg procedure across all categories and player-pair tests; primary hypothesis is the global test that any category changes, followed by per-category inference.",
